    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried the water but the pain is still like, pulsing and it feels like the heat is stuck under my skin. my friend told me that tea tree oil is actually a natural antiseptic and would help kill bacteria so it doesnt get infected, and since it's an oil it keeps it moist? im worried if i dont put something on it the skin will just dry out and crack. wouldn't the antiseptic properties be better than just leaving it alone?",
