      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't really want to go to a doctor, i'm super busy and i'm sure i can manage this myself. if i just use a thick layer of honey or maybe some aloe vera gel, wouldn't that be way safer and more effective than just waiting for it to cool? honey is basically a natural antibiotic anyway, right? i just want something i can put on it now to stop this throbbing.",
